      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787758425370,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "social-network/\n│\n├── backend/                    # Go Backend Server\n│   ├── cmd/\n│   │   └── server/\n│   │       └── main.go         # Entry point for the Go app\n│   ├── internal/\n│   │   ├── auth/               # Login, Register, Sessions & Cookies\n│   │   ├── users/              # Profiles (Public/Private) & User Activity\n│   │   ├── followers/          # Follow, Unfollow & Follow Requests\n│   │   ├── posts/              # Posts, Comments & Privacy (Public, Almost, Private)\n│   │   ├── groups/             # Groups creation, Invites & Group Feed\n│   │   ├── events/             # Group Events & RSVP (Going/Not going)\n│   │   ├── chat/               # Private Messages & Group Chats\n│   │   ├── websocket/          # Real-time Hub for active connections\n│   │   ├── notifications/      # Notifications Dispatcher\n│   │   └── utils/              # Shared helpers (Bcrypt hash, Time)\n│   ├── pkg/\n│   │   └── db/\n│   │       ├── migrations/\n│   │       │   └── sqlite/     # up.sql & down.sql files for DB creation\n│   │       └── sqlite.go       # SQLite Connection & migration logic\n│   ├── uploads/                # File system for storing Images & GIFs\n│   └── Dockerfile              # Backend container build instructions\n│\n├── frontend/                   # Next.js Frontend Framework\n│   ├── src/\n│   │   ├── app/\n│   │   │   ├── (auth)/\n│   │   │   │   ├── login/      \n│   │   │   │   └── register/   \n│   │   │   ├── profile/\n│   │   │   │   └── [username]/ # \n│   │   │   ├── groups/         # Groups discovery & specific group pages\n│   │   │   ├── chat/           # Real-time messaging interface\n│   │   │   ├── layout.js       # Navbar, Footer & Global Notifications badge\n│   │   │   └── page.js         # Main Feed (Home)\n│   │   ├── components/\n│   │   │   ├── ui/             # Reusable UI (Buttons, Forms, Modals)\n│   │   │   ├── posts/          # Post & Comment rendering components\n│   │   │   ├── groups/         # Group-specific UI elements\n│   │   │   └── chat/           # Chat window & message bubbles\n│   │   └── utils/              # API requests, WebSocket clients, formatters\n│   ├── public/                 # Static assets (Default avatars, logos)\n│   └── Dockerfile              # Frontend container build instructions\n│\n└── docker-compose.yml          # Orchestrates Backend & Frontend containers",
      "fontSize": 26.13397524870378,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "social-network/\n│\n├── backend/                    # Go Backend Server\n│   ├── cmd/\n│   │   └── server/\n│   │       └── main.go         # Entry point for the Go app\n│   ├── internal/\n│   │   ├── auth/               # Login, Register, Sessions & Cookies\n│   │   ├── users/              # Profiles (Public/Private) & User Activity\n│   │   ├── followers/          # Follow, Unfollow & Follow Requests\n│   │   ├── posts/              # Posts, Comments & Privacy (Public, Almost, Private)\n│   │   ├── groups/             # Groups creation, Invites & Group Feed\n│   │   ├── events/             # Group Events & RSVP (Going/Not going)\n│   │   ├── chat/               # Private Messages & Group Chats\n│   │   ├── websocket/          # Real-time Hub for active connections\n│   │   ├── notifications/      # Notifications Dispatcher\n│   │   └── utils/              # Shared helpers (Bcrypt hash, Time)\n│   ├── pkg/\n│   │   └── db/\n│   │       ├── migrations/\n│   │       │   └── sqlite/     # up.sql & down.sql files for DB creation\n│   │       └── sqlite.go       # SQLite Connection & migration logic\n│   ├── uploads/                # File system for storing Images & GIFs\n│   └── Dockerfile              # Backend container build instructions\n│\n├── frontend/                   # Next.js Frontend Framework\n│   ├── src/\n│   │   ├── app/\n│   │   │   ├── (auth)/\n│   │   │   │   ├── login/      \n│   │   │   │   └── register/   \n│   │   │   ├── profile/\n│   │   │   │   └── [username]/ # \n│   │   │   ├── groups/         # Groups discovery & specific group pages\n│   │   │   ├── chat/           # Real-time messaging interface\n│   │   │   ├── layout.js       # Navbar, Footer & Global Notifications badge\n│   │   │   └── page.js         # Main Feed (Home)\n│   │   ├── components/\n│   │   │   ├── ui/             # Reusable UI (Buttons, Forms, Modals)\n│   │   │   ├── posts/          # Post & Comment rendering components\n│   │   │   ├── groups/         # Group-specific UI elements\n│   │   │   └── chat/           # Chat window & message bubbles\n│   │   └── utils/              # API requests, WebSocket clients, formatters\n│   ├── public/                 # Static assets (Default avatars, logos)\n│   └── Dockerfile              # Frontend container build instructions\n│\n└── docker-compose.yml          # Orchestrates Backend & Frontend containers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
